===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*slēpaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*slab-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*slap-||to be weak, limp, languid}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{m|ofs|slēpa}} ({{etyl|fy|-}} {{m|fy|sliepe}}), {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|slāpan}} ({{etyl|nds|-}} {{m|nds|slapen}}), {{etyl|odt|-}} {{m|odt|slāpan}} ({{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|slapen}}), {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|slāfan}} ({{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|schlafen}}), {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐍃𐌻𐌴𐍀𐌰𐌽}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈslæːp.ɑn/|lang=ang}}

